{'symbol': 'EQIX', 'date': '2023-02-28 04:00:00', 'title': 'EQUINIX TO BACK FIVE NEW SOLAR FARMS IN SPAIN', 'text': "REDWOOD CITY, CALIF. , FEB. 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EQUINIX, INC.\xa0(NASDAQ: EQIX), THE WORLD'S DIGITAL INFRASTRUCTURE COMPANY™, HAS SIGNIFICANTLY INCREASED ITS BACKING OF RENEWABLE POWER PROJECTS WITH THE ADDITION OF FIVE NEW LONG-TERM POWER PURCHASE AGREEMENTS (PPAS) IN SPAIN TOTALING 225 MEGAWATTS (MW)."}